        "comments": "The assembly mLagAcu1.hap2.1 is based on 59x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosomes X and Y were identified based on PacBio read coverage and HiC signal.",
